# Portability fixes needed to run sbnd_xin's stage-B driver inside the FNAL
# SL7 apptainer (bash 4.2.46, python 3.9.15).  Applied to SCRATCH COPIES --
# sbnd_xin itself is never modified.  Reported upstream on ai-helper issue 22.
#
# 1. run_pr_chain_batch.sh:1848 hardcodes libpython3.11.so.1.0 while taking
#    LIBDIR from the running interpreter -> derive INSTSONAME instead.
# 2. _runlib.sh:_batch_reap_one uses 'wait -n -p VARNAME' (bash >= 5.1;
#    'wait -n' alone needs 4.3) -> reap by blocking on all outstanding pids.
# 3. "\${ARR[@]}" on an EMPTY array trips 'set -u' before bash 4.4, and the
#    no-TLA-override path this gate requires is exactly when they are empty
#    -> guard 25 sites with \${ARR[@]+"\${ARR[@]}"}.

